before:
Complete local Rust example; the app itself does not execute it:
```rust

macro_rules! twice {
    ($value:expr) => {{ let value = $value; value + value }};
}
fn main() {
    let mut calls = 0;
    let answer = twice!({ calls += 1; 3 });
    println!("{answer} {calls}");
}
```

